\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Exploratory annualized live-carbon change valuation. (A) Signed 2025 annualized value density, using matched FIA visits and the ESA 2022 forest mask. (B) Absolute difference in annualized value density between the 2010 and 2025 endpoint composites on shared forest pixels. Blue indicates positive valued rates or increases; red indicates negative rates or decreases. Gray cells are outside the eligible mapped support. These are live-pool change proxies, not complete atmospheric sequestration estimates.}}{16}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:carbon-sequestration-maps}{{2}{16}{Exploratory annualized live-carbon change valuation. (A) Signed 2025 annualized value density, using matched FIA visits and the ESA 2022 forest mask. (B) Absolute difference in annualized value density between the 2010 and 2025 endpoint composites on shared forest pixels. Blue indicates positive valued rates or increases; red indicates negative rates or decreases. Gray cells are outside the eligible mapped support. These are live-pool change proxies, not complete atmospheric sequestration estimates}{figure.2}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Annualized live aboveground carbon change and its SCC-valued proxy for supported matched-FIA endpoint composites. The lower panel compares endpoint SCC prices with a fixed \$21.40/tCO$_2$ valuation, in 2007 USD/year. Quantity totals retain negative live-pool changes. The 2005 estimate is unavailable, and these interpolated rates should not be interpreted as a complete annual greenhouse-gas balance or family-forest GEP.}}{17}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:carbon-sequestration-series}{{3}{17}{Annualized live aboveground carbon change and its SCC-valued proxy for supported matched-FIA endpoint composites. The lower panel compares endpoint SCC prices with a fixed \$21.40/tCO$_2$ valuation, in 2007 USD/year. Quantity totals retain negative live-pool changes. The 2005 estimate is unavailable, and these interpolated rates should not be interpreted as a complete annual greenhouse-gas balance or family-forest GEP}{figure.3}{}}
