\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Statewide mapped live aboveground carbon and its SCC-valued stock proxy for the five-year composites. The lower panel compares year-specific SCC values with a constant \$21.40/tCO$_2$ valuation, all in 2007 USD. Each point uses its own forest mask; 2025 uses ESA 2022. Connecting lines aid comparison and do not represent annual observations. Stocks and their values must not be summed across years as annual benefits.}}{21}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:carbon-storage-series}{{5}{21}{Statewide mapped live aboveground carbon and its SCC-valued stock proxy for the five-year composites. The lower panel compares year-specific SCC values with a constant \$21.40/tCO$_2$ valuation, all in 2007 USD. Each point uses its own forest mask; 2025 uses ESA 2022. Connecting lines aid comparison and do not represent annual observations. Stocks and their values must not be summed across years as annual benefits}{figure.5}{}}
